README changes from before to after\",\n  1022\t        \"NO_FINDINGS\",\n  1023\t        \"follow-up after reopen\",\n  1024\t    ]);\n  1025\t    let chat = CommandChat::new(root, backend.clone()).with_max_review_rounds(4);\n  1026\t    let mut app = TerminalApp::new(chat, 100, 24);\n  1027\t\n  1028\t    app.handle_bytes(b\":new patch readme\\n\");\n  1029\t    assert!(app.wait_for_idle(Duration::from_secs(2)));\n  1030\t\n  1031\t    let reviewed_frame = app.render_frame();\n  1032\t    assert_eq!(\n  1033\t        app.ui().selected_agent().map(AgentId::as_str),\n  1034\t        Some(\"user-1\")\n  1035\t    );\n  1036\t    assert!(reviewed_frame.contains(\"work-leaf: Is this feature done? yes/no\"));\n  1037\t    assert!(left_pane_row(&app.ui().render_left_pane(), \"user-1\").contains(\"READY\"));\n  1038\t\n  1039\t    app.handle_bytes(b\"yes\\n\");\n  1040\t    assert!(app.wait_for_idle(Duration::from_secs(1)));\n  1041\t\n  1042\t    let closed_frame = app.render_frame();\n  1043\t    assert!(closed_frame.contains(\"user: yes\"));\n  1044\t    assert!(closed_frame.contains(\"work-leaf: feature closed\"));\n  1045\t    assert!(!left_pane_row(&app.ui().render_left_pane(), \"user-1\").contains(\"READY\"));\n  1046\t\n  1047\t    app.handle_bytes(b\"add another pass\\n\");\n  1048\t    assert!(app.wait_for_idle(Duration::from_secs(1)));\n  1049\t\n  1050\t    let reopened_frame = app.render_frame();\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
