{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_45","type":"agent_message","text":"The review confirmation implementation has an important behavioral detail for the plan: `yes` is consumed by the controller and does not go to the backend, while later non-confirmation chat reopens the feature and resumes normal sending. I’m checking whether there are merge-order dependencies among the three request groups before I finalize the linearization order."}}
