{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_50","type":"agent_message","text":"One ordering dependency is real: request 2’s terminal slash shortcut reuses `TerminalUi::is_visual_active()` introduced by request 1, and request 3 builds on the already routed terminal/controller send paths. The natural final order is therefore the same 1, 2, 3 order, with each range squashed into its request commit."}}
