ior on later chat, terminal ready-highlight closure through `src/terminal_app.rs::session_feature_closed`, duplicate-safe state-line handling, and the workspace/terminal/harness regression tests. Add docs in `docs/architecture.md`, `docs/orchestrator-file-workflow.md` Review Flow/Developer Path, and `Spec.md` Reviews.\n\nAfter acceptance, I’ll rewrite the history rooted at `c92a0b7` into exactly those three commits, fold each request’s fixes/tests/docs into its own commit, then run the required checks. Real-agent verification is waived for this benchmark checkout by the repo’s provider-isolation policy."}}
